        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1 : There are 333 subsequences, [1][1][1], [2][2][2], and [1,2][1, 2][1,2]. The third one has f(C)=1f(C) = 1f(C)=1, the others have f(C)=0f(C) = 0f(C)=0.\nTest Case 2 : There are 777 subsequences, [1][1][1], [2][2][2] and [3][3][3] have f(C)=0f(C) = 0f(C)=0. [1,2][1, 2][1,2], [2,3][2, 3][2,3] and [1,2,3][1, 2, 3][1,2,3] have f(C)=1f(C) = 1f(C)=1. Finally, [1,3][1, 3][1,3] has f(C)=2f(C) = 2f(C)=2. The sum is 555."
